# BREBO Measure API v0.1 examples
# Replace IDs with values from BREBO Office.

GET https://example.invalid/brebo-office/api/measure/openings/1
Accept: application/json

###
POST https://example.invalid/brebo-office/api/measure/openings/1/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{"requirements":{"reference_side":"inside","control_dimensions_required":true}}

###
POST https://example.invalid/brebo-office/api/measure/assignments/1/captures
Content-Type: application/json

{"source_type":"apple_lidar","device_model":"iPhone Pro","software_version":"measure-ios/0.1","geometry":{},"quality":{}}

###
POST https://example.invalid/brebo-office/api/measure/captures/1/observations
Content-Type: application/json

{"key":"opening.width.middle","provenance":"measured","method":"lidar","value":{"value":1843,"unit":"mm"},"confidence":0.92,"uncertainty_mm":2.0}
